<h4>Default Portfolio Breadcrumbs</h4>
<p>
	To set the correct default <b>Portfolio/Project</b> custom post type breadcrumbs, you should go to <kbd><kbd><samp>Settings</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Breadcrumb NavXT</samp></kbd></kbd> and click on the <b>Post Types</b> tab. Scroll down to the <b>Portfolio Item</b> section, and set the <b>Portfolio Item Root Page</b> to your "Used Cars" page (or the page containing your Portfolio Grid widget), then disable (uncheck) the <b>Portfolio Item Archive Display</b> and <b>Portfolio Item Hierarchy Display</b> checkboxes. Save the settings.
</p>
<p>One Click Demo Import applies these breadcrumb settings automatically.</p>
